#: app/templates/auth/privacy.html:51
msgid "7. Himoya choralari"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/auth/privacy.html:52
msgid "Parollar shifrlangan xesh ko‘rinishida saqlanadi, ulanish HTTPS orqali amalga oshiriladi, zaxira nusxalar shifrlanadi, xodimlarning ma’lumotlarga kirishi cheklanadi va jurnalga yoziladi."
