#: app/templates/auth/privacy.html:62
msgid "9. Cookie fayllar"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/auth/privacy.html:63
msgid "Platforma faqat tizimga kirishni saqlash va sozlamalarni (masalan, yorug‘/qorong‘i mavzu) eslab qolish uchun zarur cookie va brauzer xotirasidan foydalanadi."
